<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi port handles 40,907 tonnes cargo.</title>
<headline>Karachi port handles 40,907 tonnes cargo.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Karachi Port Trust said it had handled 40,094 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours to 7 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Tuesday, compared to 64,441 tonnes on Monday.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>					    Tuesday	   Previous</p>
<p>    Export cargo			 6,921	    16,400</p>
<p>    Import cargo			33,986	    48,041</p>
<p>In the past 24 hours, four ships sailed and six berthed. In the next 24 hours, six ships are expected to sail and five to arrive.</p>
</text>
